  "body": "<!-- docker-image-provenance:start -->\n## Docker Image Provenance\n\n**Image Reference:** `docker.io/schemacrawler/schemacrawler@sha256:804d9da89b1fe43707791d7cb649025de0a8e193f09bb271eb3b5e494221d125`\n\n**Digest:** `sha256:804d9da89b1fe43707791d7cb649025de0a8e193f09bb271eb3b5e494221d125`\n\n**Attestation Status:** Signed provenance available\n\n[View attestation](https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/attestations/68455495)\n<!-- docker-image-provenance:end -->\n\nSchemaCrawler  release at last commit 59b4cbe83ad1eed74e161dde4922321aa1092890\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump com.clickhouse:clickhouse-jdbc from 0.11.0 to 0.11.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2559\n* Bump com.typesafe:config from 1.4.9 to 1.4.10 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2558\n* Bump org.thymeleaf:thymeleaf from 3.1.5.RELEASE to 3.1.6.RELEASE by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2557\n* Attest Docker image by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2561\n* Use newer release of attestion action by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2563\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.8.0 to 1.8.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2562\n* Prepare for the next release by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2564\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v18.0.2...v18.0.3",
